// WuwaToonBasePass_Monster.ush — M_CharMonster base pass (BP summons / props), MSM_ToonCommon (GBufferB id 12 / 14), round 3 of
// research/roster/Port_Weapons_Specials.md. New file; the verified headers are only #included.
//
// Line refs M### = asm_hex of PS __262861 (8c9c45e4d2, MI_EFuluoluoHekateMD10011Head/Arms/Weapon), instruction index (1-based).
// M_CharMonster is NOT the M_Char_Com body:
//   * the fixed-angle light direction is evaluated in the PS (no VS TEXCOORD2): pitch = 45 + MPC GlobalCharacterVerticalRotation,
//     yaw = CPD0 (+ LightOffset_Yaw when UseLightOffset_Yaw_DYN), lerped toward MPC GlobalCharacterDebugLightDirection by
//     1 - saturate(CPD1), then toward the toon point light (anchor = object + 150 z) by distance and ToonLight3.z      (M57-158)
//   * lighting uses the normal-mapped world normal before the View[144] override / two-sided flip; the GBuffer normal is the
//     overridden one (x TwoSidedSign)                                                                                  (M17-38)
//   * GGX PBR (EnvBRDFApprox(saturate NoV), D_GGX with a hard-spec smoothstep, half-Lambert "range dissolve"), matcap by
//     roughness, PBRIndirectColor, rough > 0.95 && metal <= 0.05 -> unlit base colour                                  (M168-266)
//   * MainTex.a emission (pow(a, Main_EmissionPower) >= 0.5 x (clamp(a, 0.5, 0.9) - 0.5) x 2.5), "Attack" fresnel rim /
//     dark scale on UV3.y, GI tint View[292] x GI_Blend, ShadowLord colour texture on UV3 (x UseShadowLordMaterialDynamic)
//   * GBufferA.z from MainTex.a (<= 0.38) through SolidShadowThreshold / ShadowOffset / ShadowRange; GBufferB = sqrt(saturate(
//     solid-shadow colour)); id 14 when ToonShadowBlendCSMMask > 0; mode 0: A.w = 1/3, D = (ToonRimWidth, rough nibble, 0, 0)
// Compile-time switches of WuwaToonMonsterBasePass_Impl (one entry per cooked PS hash, generated by
// tools/shaderdiff/weapons/r3/monster_gen_entries.py from r3/monster_table.py):
//   bTwoSided (N x TwoSidedSign, re-normalised encode), bSDF (MainTex.a >= 0.95 SDF metal / rough / flow emissive, e387),
//   bSDFCircle (UV0 circle variant of the SDF flow, ae5e), bCube (PBRCubeMap reflection + edge EnvBRDF + spec mask instead of the
//   matcap, ec80), bSecond (Second layer, 5229), bNoise (R_Noise_A_Mask.r UV noise on the Second UV, a158), bFlowEdge (effect-mask UV
//   += Second_RGB.r x FlowEffectEdge_Strength x 0.1), bBump (bump offset of the Second UV, 6d0f), bFresnelRim (view fresnel rim colour
//   under the effect mask, e5a2), bMaskR / bMaskRGB (effect-mask channel .r / .rgb instead of .a), bAO (AOmap.r wrap), bBreath
//   (breathing emission), bTranslucentDither (masked: UseTranslucent screen dither + Kuro primitive dither, OpacityMask out, a605),
//   bFresnelLit (lit-colour fresnel rim x VC.a, 8165), bSpark (CommonNoiseMap.b spark taps x shadow weight x AOmap.g, 8165).
// The VS of every ported hash is the stock GPU-skin VS plus the UV3-dissolve WPO multiplied by UseShadowLordMaterialDynamic = 0
// at every roster MI (gated, not ported).
#pragma once
#ifndef WUWA_MONSTER_USH
#define WUWA_MONSTER_USH

#include "WuwaToonBasePass_WeaponShared.ush"

float WuwaMOSmooth(float x) { float k = x * -2.0 + 3.0; return (x * x) * k; }
float WuwaMOSignSat(float x) { return saturate((float)WuwaKuroSignI(x)); }   // ilt / ilt / iadd / itof / sat (M402-406)

// Placeholder TextureCube passed by the entries without UseCubeMap: that path is compile-time dead (bCube = false), so the
// compiler removes every reference and the resource is never bound.
TextureCube WuwaMODummyCube;

// M57-158: M_CharMonster PS light direction.
float3 WuwaMOLightDir(float MPC_GlobalCharacterVerticalRotation, float CPD0, float CPD1, float UseLightOffset_Yaw_DYN,
	float LightOffset_Yaw, float3 MPC_GlobalCharacterDebugLightDirection, float4 ToonLight0, float4 ToonLight3,
	float3 ObjectWorldPosition)
{
	float sp, cp, sy, cy;
	WuwaKuroSinCosDeg(MPC_GlobalCharacterVerticalRotation + 45.0, sp, cp);
	float yaw = (UseLightOffset_Yaw_DYN >= 0.5) ? (CPD0 + LightOffset_Yaw) : CPD0;
	WuwaKuroSinCosDeg(yaw, sy, cy);
	float3 d = float3(cp * cy, sy * cp, sp);
	d = d / sqrt(dot(d, d));
	float3 Lb = saturate(CPD1) * (d - MPC_GlobalCharacterDebugLightDirection) + MPC_GlobalCharacterDebugLightDirection;
	float3 anchor = ObjectWorldPosition + float3(0.0, 0.0, 150.0);
	float3 Lpt = ToonLight0.xyz - anchor;
	Lpt = Lpt / sqrt(dot(Lpt, Lpt));
	float3 dA = anchor - ToonLight0.xyz;
	float  distFrac = saturate(sqrt(dot(dA, dA)) * ToonLight0.w);
	float3 Lm = distFrac * (Lb - Lpt) + Lpt;
	float3 L = ToonLight3.z * (Lm - Lb) + Lb;
	return L / sqrt(dot(L, L));
}

FWuwaToonGBuffer WuwaToonMonsterBasePass_Impl(const bool bTwoSided, const bool bSDF, const bool bCube, const bool bSecond,
	const bool bFresnelRim, const bool bMaskR, const bool bAO, const bool bSDFCircle, const bool bNoise, const bool bFlowEdge,
	const bool bBump, const bool bMaskRGB, const bool bBreath, const bool bTranslucentDither,
	const bool bFresnelLit, const bool bSpark,
	Texture2D Normal_Roughness_Metallic, SamplerState Normal_Roughness_MetallicSampler,
	Texture2D MainTex, SamplerState MainTexSampler,
	Texture2D MatCapTex, SamplerState MatCapTexSampler,
	Texture2D CommonNoiseMap, SamplerState CommonNoiseMapSampler,
	TextureCube PBRCubeMap, SamplerState PBRCubeMapSampler,
	Texture2D Second_RGB, SamplerState Second_RGBSampler,
	Texture2D R_Noise_A_Mask, SamplerState R_Noise_A_MaskSampler,
	Texture2D AOmap, SamplerState AOmapSampler,
	Texture2D TranslucentDitherTex, SamplerState TranslucentDitherTexSampler,
	Texture2D ShadowLord_ColorTex, SamplerState ShadowLord_ColorTexSampler,
	float2 UV0, float2 UV1, float2 UV2, float2 UV3, float3 WorldTangent, float3 WorldNormal, float TangentSign, float TwoSidedSign,
	float3 WorldPosition, float3 TranslatedWorldPosition, float3 CameraVector,
	float2 SvPositionXY, float2 ViewRectMin, float4 ViewSizeAndInvSize,
	float NormalStrength, float3 MainTexColorTint, float FresnelAttackFactor, float MetallicIntensity, float RoughnessIntensity,
	float UseSpecularMask, float UseLightOffset_Yaw_DYN, float LightOffset_Yaw, float PBRHardSpecWidth_Test,
	float MatCapInt, float MetalMatCapBack, float MetalMatCapInt, float PBRHardSpeSmooth_Test,
	float PBRSpecularRangeDessolve_Threshold, float PBRSpecularRangeDessolve_Smooth, float PBRSpecularRangeDessolve_Intensity,
	float3 PBRSpecularColor_Test, float3 PBRIndirectColor, float PBRRateIntensity, float Main_EmissionPower, float3 EmissionColor,
	float AttackDarkScale, float AttackFresnelRimRange, float3 AttackFresnelRimColor, float AttackFresnelRimIntensity,
	float4 SelectionColor, float GI_Blend, float4 ShadowLord_ColorTiling, float3 ShadowLord_ColorMulti, float ShadowLord_ColorOpacity,
	float UseShadowLordMaterialDynamic, float3 ShadowColor, float SolidShadowView, float SolidShadowSaturation,
	float SolidShadowThreshold, float ShadowOffset, float ShadowRange, float SolidShadowStrength, float ToonRimWidth,
	float ToonShadowBlendCSMMask, float SDFMetallicInt, float SDFRoughnessInt, float SDFTimeSpeed, float SDFNormalInt, float4 SDFColor,
	float EdgeEnvBRDFIntensity, float PBRCubeMap_Test, float3 PBRCubemapColor,
	float4 SecondTex_UVSwitch, float Second_UseScreenUV, float Second_RotCos, float Second_RotSin, float4 Second_UV, float2 Second_UV_Offset,
	float4 Second_Refine, float3 Second_ColorTint, float EffectMaskTexUV2Switch, float Effect_Progress,
	float FresnelRim_RimRange, float FresnelRim_Smooth, float FresnelRim_Reverse, float3 FresnelRim_RimColor, float3 EffectMaskColor,
	float AOIntensity, float SDFCirclePositionX, float SDFCirclePositionY, float SDFCircleScaleX, float SDFCircleScaleY,
	float SDFCircleScale, float SDFCircleWidth, float SDFCircleIntensity,
	float4 Noise_UVSwitch, float Noise_UseScreenUV, float4 NoiseUV, float NoiseStrength, float Second_NoiseStrength, float FlowEffectEdge_Strength,
	float Second_BumpHeight, float Second_BumpHeightRadio, float BreatheFrequency, float BreatheStrength, float BreathePropotion,
	float EmissionStrength, float EmissionBreathThreshold, float UseTranslucent, float TranslucentDitherVaule,
	float TemporalAAParamsX, float KuroPrimDitherEnable, float KuroPrimDitherFade,
	float Fresnel_NormalLerp, float Fresnel_RimRange, float Fresnel_RimFraction, float Fresnel_Hard, float Fresnel_LeftRight,
	float3 Fresnel_RimColor, float Fresnel_RimIntensity, float VertexColorA,
	float4 StarrySky_UV_Switch, float SparkTiling, float SparkTimeSpeed, float SparkIntensity, float SparkPower, float SparkIntensityInShadow,
	float3 SparkColor,
	float CPD0, float CPD1, float MPC_GlobalCharacterVerticalRotation, float3 MPC_GlobalCharacterDebugLightDirection,
	float4 ToonLight0, float4 ToonLight3, float3 KuroViewGIColor,
	float4x4 TranslatedWorldToView, float MaterialTextureMipBias, float4 NormalOverrideParameter, float KuroGBufferMode,
	float3 KuroEmissiveScale, float KuroSkipEmissiveScale, float OutOfBoundsMask, float3 ObjectWorldPosition, float3 ObjectBounds,
	uint LightingChannelMask, float GameTime, out float OpacityMask)
{
	FWuwaToonGBuffer G;
	OpacityMask = 1.0;
	const float3 V = CameraVector;

	// M1-5: bitangent, screen UV
	float3 TangentY = cross(WorldNormal, WorldTangent) * TangentSign;
	float2 ScreenUV = (SvPositionXY - ViewRectMin) * ViewSizeAndInvSize.zw;

	// M17-25: normal map -> world (lighting normal Nl, sqrt / div)
	float4 NRM = Normal_Roughness_Metallic.SampleBias(Normal_Roughness_MetallicSampler, UV0, MaterialTextureMipBias);
	float2 nxy = (NRM.xy * 2.0 + -1.0) * NormalStrength;
	float3 Nl = TangentY * nxy.y;
	Nl = nxy.x * WorldTangent + Nl;
	Nl = Nl + WorldNormal;
	Nl = Nl / sqrt(dot(Nl, Nl));

	// M26-38: back to tangent space, View[144] override, to world (GBuffer normal N, x TwoSidedSign)
	float3 nT = float3(dot(WorldTangent, Nl), dot(TangentY, Nl), dot(WorldNormal, Nl));
	nT = nT * NormalOverrideParameter.w + NormalOverrideParameter.xyz;
	nT = nT * rsqrt(dot(nT, nT));
	float3 N = TangentY * nT.y;
	N = nT.x * WorldTangent + N;
	N = nT.z * WorldNormal + N;
	N = N * rsqrt(dot(N, N));
	if (bTwoSided)
	{
		N = TwoSidedSign * N;
	}

	// M39-52: base colour (fresnel-attack grey), metal / roughness
	float  Dark0 = 1.0 - UV3.y;
	float4 MT = MainTex.SampleBias(MainTexSampler, UV0, MaterialTextureMipBias);
	float3 TexColor = MT.rgb * MainTexColorTint;
	float  lum = dot(TexColor, float3(0.3, 0.59, 0.11));
	lum = saturate((lum + -0.1) * 0.3 + lum);
	float3 BaseCol = FresnelAttackFactor * (lum - MainTexColorTint * MT.rgb) + TexColor;
	float  Metallic = NRM.z * MetallicIntensity;
	float  sdf = (MT.a >= asfloat(0x3F733333u)) ? 1.0 : 0.0;           // bSDF: MainTex.a >= 0.95 (e387 l.49-59)
	if (bSDF)
	{
		Metallic = sdf * (SDFMetallicInt - MetallicIntensity * NRM.z) + Metallic;
	}
	float  RoughA = NRM.w * RoughnessIntensity;
	RoughA = UseSpecularMask * (NRM.w - NRM.w * RoughnessIntensity) + RoughA;
	if (bSDF)
	{
		RoughA = sdf * (SDFRoughnessInt - RoughA) + RoughA;
	}
	float  RoughB = UseSpecularMask * (RoughnessIntensity - RoughA) + RoughA;

	// M57-158: light direction
	float3 L = WuwaMOLightDir(MPC_GlobalCharacterVerticalRotation, CPD0, CPD1, UseLightOffset_Yaw_DYN, LightOffset_Yaw,
		MPC_GlobalCharacterDebugLightDirection, ToonLight0, ToonLight3, ObjectWorldPosition);

	// M159-174: H, NoH / NoV / NoL on the lighting normal, hard-spec width
	float3 H = V + L;
	H = H / sqrt(dot(H, H));
	float NoH = saturate(dot(Nl, H));
	float NoVr = dot(Nl, V);
	float NoV = saturate(NoVr);
	float NoLr = dot(Nl, L);
	float NoL = saturate(NoLr);
	float hw0 = max(PBRHardSpecWidth_Test, 0.01);
	float hw = -(RoughA + -0.6) * 2.0 + hw0;
	hw = ((0.6 >= RoughA) ? 1.0 : 0.0) * (hw0 - hw) + hw;
	bool  bRoughLE095 = (0.95 >= RoughA);
	float HL = NoLr * 0.5 + 0.5;

	// M175-188: view-space matcap UV (Pv summed in (y, z, x) order)
	float3 Pv = mul(float4(TranslatedWorldPosition, 1.0), TranslatedWorldToView).xyz;
	float3 PvYZX = min(Pv.yzx, 3.402823466e+38);   // pins the (y, z, x) summation order of the original dp3 (as in the CharWeapon port)
	Pv = Pv / sqrt(dot(PvYZX, PvYZX));
	float3 Nv = mul(N, (float3x3)TranslatedWorldToView);
	float2 MatCapUV = float2(Pv.z * Nv.x - Pv.x * Nv.z, Pv.y * Nv.z - Pv.z * Nv.y) * 0.5 + 0.5;
	float4 MC = MatCapTex.SampleBias(MatCapTexSampler, MatCapUV, MaterialTextureMipBias);

	// M189-208: matcap channel by roughness, back / lit intensity by half-Lambert
	float  mc = saturate(RoughA * 3.0) * (MC.y - MC.x) + MC.x;
	float2 ab = saturate(RoughA * float2(3.0, 3.0) + float2(-1.0, -2.0));
	mc = ab.x * (MC.z - mc) + mc;
	mc = ab.y * (MC.w - mc) + mc;
	float backI = Metallic * (MetalMatCapBack - MatCapInt) + MatCapInt;
	float hl2 = saturate(HL * asfloat(0x40366666u)) * 0.5 + 0.5;
	float hl2i = 1.0 - hl2;
	float litI = Metallic * (MetalMatCapInt - MatCapInt) + MatCapInt;
	float mcI = hl2 * (-backI * hl2i + litI) + backI * hl2i;
	mc = mcI * mc;

	// M209-222: diffuse / spec colour, EnvBRDFApprox(saturate NoV)
	float  kd = Metallic * asfloat(0xBF75C28Fu) + asfloat(0x3F75C28Fu);
	float3 DiffC = kd * BaseCol;
	float3 SpecC = Metallic * (BaseCol + asfloat(0xBD23D70Au)) + asfloat(0x3D23D70Au);
	float4 eb = RoughB * float4(-1.0, asfloat(0xBCE147AEu), asfloat(0xBF126E98u), asfloat(0x3CB43958u))
		+ float4(1.0, asfloat(0x3D2E147Bu), asfloat(0x3F851EB8u), asfloat(0xBD23D70Au));
	float  a004 = min(exp2(NoV * asfloat(0xC1147AE1u)), eb.x * eb.x) * eb.x + eb.y;
	float2 AB = a004 * float2(asfloat(0xBF851EB8u), asfloat(0x3F851EB8u)) + eb.zw;
	float3 EnvBRDF = SpecC * AB.x + saturate(SpecC.g * 50.0) * AB.y;
	float  SpecMask = 1.0;
	if (bCube)   // ec80 l.172, 187-189: edge EnvBRDF lerp by saturate(NoV), UseSpecularMask highlight mask
	{
		float3 EnvE = EnvBRDF * EdgeEnvBRDFIntensity;
		EnvBRDF = NoV * (EnvBRDF - EnvBRDF * EdgeEnvBRDFIntensity) + EnvE;
		SpecMask = UseSpecularMask * (RoughA + -1.0) + 1.0;
	}

	// M223-242: GGX D, hard-spec smoothstep
	float a2 = max(RoughB * RoughB, asfloat(0x3B03126Fu));
	a2 = a2 * a2;
	float dd = NoH * a2 - NoH;
	dd = dd * NoH + asfloat(0x3F800054u);
	float D = (a2 * asfloat(0x3EA2F983u)) / (dd * dd + asfloat(0x33D6BF95u));
	float hs = max(PBRHardSpeSmooth_Test, 0.001);
	float hhi = hw + hs;
	float hlo = min((hs + 1.0) * hw - hs, hhi + asfloat(0xBA83126Fu));
	float hsp = WuwaMOSmooth(saturate((D - hlo) * (1.0 / (hhi - hlo))));

	// M243-253: half-Lambert range dissolve of the highlight
	float rd = WuwaMOSmooth(saturate((1.0 / (PBRSpecularRangeDessolve_Smooth - PBRSpecularRangeDessolve_Threshold)) *
		(HL - PBRSpecularRangeDessolve_Threshold)));
	float3 SpecHL = hsp * (EnvBRDF * PBRSpecularColor_Test);
	if (bCube)   // ec80 l.219-222
	{
		float3 SpecM = SpecMask * SpecHL;
		SpecHL = PBRSpecularRangeDessolve_Intensity * ((rd * SpecHL) * SpecMask - SpecM) + SpecM;
	}
	else
	{
		SpecHL = PBRSpecularRangeDessolve_Intensity * (SpecHL * rd - SpecHL) + SpecHL;
	}

	// M254-266: lit colour
	float  wrap = NoL * 0.5 + 1.0;
	float4 AOt = float4(1.0, 1.0, 1.0, 1.0);
	if (bAO || bSpark)
	{
		AOt = AOmap.SampleBias(AOmapSampler, UV0, MaterialTextureMipBias);
	}
	if (bAO)   // 5d2c l.103-105, 301-302: AOmap.r (UV0) -> wrap = (ao NoL) 0.5 + ao
	{
		float ao = AOt.r;
		ao = AOIntensity * (ao + -1.0) + 1.0;
		wrap = (ao * NoL) * 0.5 + ao;
	}
	float3 Lit = BaseCol * kd + SpecHL;
	float3 Ind;
	if (bCube)   // ec80 l.50-52, 223-235: reflection cube (SampleLevel, lod = rough (1.7 - 0.7 rough) 6) instead of the matcap
	{
		float3 Rv = (NoVr * Nl) * 2.0 - V;
		float  lod = (RoughB * asfloat(0xBF333333u) + asfloat(0x3FD9999Au)) * RoughB;
		lod = lod * 6.0;
		float3 cube = PBRCubeMap.SampleLevel(PBRCubeMapSampler, Rv, lod).rgb;
		cube = PBRCubeMap_Test * (cube + -1.0) + 1.0;
		cube = ((EnvBRDF * cube) * PBRCubemapColor) * SpecMask;
		Ind = (DiffC * PBRIndirectColor + cube) * wrap;
	}
	else
	{
		Ind = (DiffC * PBRIndirectColor + EnvBRDF) * wrap;
		Ind = mc * Ind;
	}
	Lit = Lit * hl2 + Ind;
	Lit = PBRRateIntensity * (Lit - BaseCol) + BaseCol;
	float unlit = bRoughLE095 ? 0.0 : ((0.05 >= Metallic) ? 1.0 : 0.0);
	Lit = unlit * (BaseCol - Lit) + Lit;

	// M267-279: MainTex.a emission
	float ep = exp2(log2(MT.a) * Main_EmissionPower);
	float ew = (min(max(MT.a, 0.5), asfloat(0x3F666666u)) + -0.5) * 2.5;
	ew = ew * ((ep >= 0.5) ? 1.0 : 0.0);
	float3 Em = ew * Lit;
	float3 EmC = Em * EmissionColor;
	if (bBreath)   // 6d0f l.305-316: breathing emission (cos(time x BreatheFrequency)), steady when ew <= EmissionBreathThreshold
	{
		float  br = cos(GameTime * BreatheFrequency);
		br = BreatheStrength * br + BreatheStrength * BreathePropotion;
		br = br * EmissionStrength;
		float3 EmB = EmC * br;
		float  sel = (EmissionBreathThreshold >= ew) ? 1.0 : 0.0;
		EmC = sel * (EmissionColor * Em - EmB) + EmB;
	}
	// M385-391 / M408-425: MainTex.a shadow mask and the toon shadow term (GBufferA.z; also the bSpark shadow weight)
	float sm = ((MT.a >= 0.0) ? 1.0 : 0.0) * ((asfloat(0x3EC28F5Cu) >= MT.a) ? 1.0 : 0.0);
	sm = sm * (0.5 - MT.a) + 0.5;
	float t2 = sm - SolidShadowThreshold;
	float so = sm + ShadowOffset;
	float k2 = (t2 / (1.0 - SolidShadowThreshold)) * (1.0 - so);
	so = saturate(WuwaMOSignSat(t2) * k2 + so);
	so = so * asfloat(0x3F82EE63u) - HL;
	so = (so + ShadowRange * -1.0) / ShadowRange;
	so = 1.0 - saturate(so + 1.0);

	float3 E0 = EmC;
	if (bFresnelLit)   // 8165 l.264-290: lit-colour fresnel rim (normal lerp toward the vertex normal, hard cut, left / right cut, x VC.a)
	{
		float3 nN = WorldNormal / sqrt(dot(WorldNormal, WorldNormal));
		float3 Nf = Fresnel_NormalLerp * (nN - Nl) + Nl;
		float  f = 1.0 - max(dot(Nf, V), 0.0);
		f = exp2(log2(max(abs(f), asfloat(0x38D1B717u))) * Fresnel_RimRange);
		f = f * (1.0 - Fresnel_RimFraction) + Fresnel_RimFraction;
		f = f * ((f >= Fresnel_Hard) ? 1.0 : 0.0);
		float  lr = mul(nN, (float3x3)TranslatedWorldToView).x;
		f = f * ((Fresnel_LeftRight >= lr) ? 1.0 : 0.0);
		float3 FRl = (((Lit * Fresnel_RimColor) * f) * Fresnel_RimIntensity) * VertexColorA;
		E0 = EmissionColor * Em + FRl;
	}
	if (bSDF)   // e387 l.280-288: SDF flow texture (CommonNoiseMap.x at NRM.xy * SDFNormalInt + frac(time * speed) + NRM.z)
	{
		float  sdfOff = NRM.z;
		float  sdfK = sdf;
		if (bSDFCircle)   // ae5e l.301-316: UV0 circle c0 replaces the NRM.z offset / sdf weight outside the SDF texels
		{
			float2 cc = (UV0 - float2(SDFCirclePositionX, SDFCirclePositionY)) * float2(SDFCircleScaleX, SDFCircleScaleY);
			float  c0 = 1.0 - sqrt(dot(cc, cc)) * (1.0 / max(1e-05, SDFCircleScale));
			c0 = saturate(c0 * (1.0 / max(1.0 - SDFCircleWidth, 1e-05)));
			sdfOff = sdf * (NRM.z - c0) + c0;
			float cI = c0 * SDFCircleIntensity;
			sdfK = sdf * (1.0 - c0 * SDFCircleIntensity) + cI;
		}
		float  st = frac(GameTime * SDFTimeSpeed) + sdfOff;
		float2 suv = NRM.xy * SDFNormalInt + st;
		float  s = sdfK * CommonNoiseMap.SampleBias(CommonNoiseMapSampler, suv, MaterialTextureMipBias).x;
		E0 = sdfK * ((s * SDFColor.rgb) * SDFColor.a - EmC) + EmC;
	}
	if (bSecond || bFresnelRim)
	{
		// 5229 l.41-71 (bSecond): Second layer (switch / screen UV, CPU cos/sin rotation, fmod(time, 600) scroll, refine) x tint;
		//   the (Second_NoiseStrength * 0) UV term of the cooked map is 0 and not written
		// e5a2 l.41-51 / 5d2c l.71-82 (bFresnelRim): view fresnel on the GBuffer normal, + FresnelRim_RimColor x rim; without
		//   bSecond the base colour is EffectMaskColor
		// effect mask: pow(R_Noise_A_Mask.a (.r with bMaskR) at lerp(UV0, UV2), 1 - Effect_Progress); E0 += mask x colour (5229 l.314)
		float3 S2 = float3(0.0, 0.0, 0.0);
		float  nz = 0.0;
		float  S2r = 0.0;
		if (bSecond)
		{
			float2 suv;
			suv.x = dot(SecondTex_UVSwitch, float4(UV0.x, UV1.x, UV2.x, UV3.x));
			suv.y = dot(SecondTex_UVSwitch, float4(UV0.y, UV1.y, UV2.y, UV3.y));
			suv = Second_UseScreenUV * (ScreenUV - suv) + suv;
			suv = suv + -0.5;
			suv = float2(dot(suv, float2(Second_RotCos, -Second_RotSin)), dot(suv, float2(Second_RotSin, Second_RotCos))) + 0.5;
			float  t600 = fmod(GameTime, 600.0);
			suv = suv * Second_UV.xy + t600 * Second_UV.zw;
			suv = suv + Second_UV_Offset;
			if (bNoise)   // a158 l.61-69: R_Noise_A_Mask.r noise (switch / screen UV, x NoiseUV.xy + time x NoiseUV.zw) displaces the Second UV
			{
				float2 nuv;
				nuv.x = dot(Noise_UVSwitch, float4(UV0.x, UV1.x, UV2.x, UV3.x));
				nuv.y = dot(Noise_UVSwitch, float4(UV0.y, UV1.y, UV2.y, UV3.y));
				nuv = Noise_UseScreenUV * (ScreenUV - nuv) + nuv;
				nuv = nuv * NoiseUV.xy;
				nuv = GameTime * NoiseUV.zw + nuv;
				nz = R_Noise_A_Mask.SampleBias(R_Noise_A_MaskSampler, nuv, MaterialTextureMipBias).r * NoiseStrength;
				suv = Second_NoiseStrength * nz + suv;
			}
			if (bBump)   // 6d0f l.66-70: bump offset (dot(T, V), dot(B, V)) x BumpHeightRadio (BumpHeight - 0.5)
			{
				float bh = Second_BumpHeightRadio * Second_BumpHeight + Second_BumpHeightRadio * -0.5;
				suv = float2(dot(WorldTangent, V), dot(TangentY, V)) * bh + suv;
			}
			S2 = Second_RGB.SampleBias(Second_RGBSampler, suv, MaterialTextureMipBias).rgb;
			S2r = S2.r;
			float3 S2p;
			S2p.x = WuwaWPowGuard(S2.x, Second_Refine.x);
			S2p.y = WuwaWPowGuard(S2.y, Second_Refine.x);
			S2p.z = WuwaWPowGuard(S2.z, Second_Refine.x);
			S2p = S2p * Second_Refine.y;
			S2 = Second_Refine.w * (S2 * Second_Refine.z - S2p) + S2p;
		}
		float3 X;
		if (bFresnelRim)
		{
			float fr2 = 1.0 - max(dot(N, V), 0.0);
			fr2 = exp2(log2(max(abs(fr2), asfloat(0x38D1B717u))) * FresnelRim_RimRange);
			fr2 = fr2 * (1.0 - FresnelRim_Smooth) + FresnelRim_Smooth;
			fr2 = FresnelRim_Reverse * (fr2 * -2.0 + 1.0) + fr2;
			if (bSecond)
			{
				X = S2 * Second_ColorTint + fr2 * FresnelRim_RimColor;
			}
			else
			{
				X = FresnelRim_RimColor * fr2 + EffectMaskColor;
			}
		}
		else
		{
			X = S2 * Second_ColorTint;
		}
		float2 euv = EffectMaskTexUV2Switch * (UV2 - UV0) + UV0;
		if (bFlowEdge)   // a158 l.82: flow-edge displacement of the effect-mask UV by the raw Second_RGB.r
		{
			euv = S2r * (FlowEffectEdge_Strength * 0.1) + euv;
		}
		float4 EMt = R_Noise_A_Mask.SampleBias(R_Noise_A_MaskSampler, euv, MaterialTextureMipBias);
		if (bMaskRGB)   // 6d0f l.83-88, 317: per-channel mask
		{
			float3 em3;
			em3.x = WuwaWPowGuard(EMt.r, 1.0 - Effect_Progress);
			em3.y = WuwaWPowGuard(EMt.g, 1.0 - Effect_Progress);
			em3.z = WuwaWPowGuard(EMt.b, 1.0 - Effect_Progress);
			E0 = em3 * X + E0;
		}
		else
		{
			float  em = bMaskR ? EMt.r : EMt.a;
			em = WuwaWPowGuard(em, 1.0 - Effect_Progress);
			E0 = em * X + E0;
		}
	}
	if (bSpark)   // 8165 l.291-331: two CommonNoiseMap.b spark taps (UV switch x SparkTiling; + time, + 0.2 V.xy), pow, shadow weight, AO.g
	{
		float2 spuv;
		spuv.x = dot(StarrySky_UV_Switch, float4(UV0.x, UV1.x, UV2.x, UV3.x));
		spuv.y = dot(StarrySky_UV_Switch, float4(UV0.y, UV1.y, UV2.y, UV3.y));
		spuv = spuv * SparkTiling;
		float  s1 = CommonNoiseMap.SampleBias(CommonNoiseMapSampler, spuv, MaterialTextureMipBias).b;
		float2 spuv2 = GameTime * float2(SparkTimeSpeed, SparkTimeSpeed * -1.0) + spuv;
		spuv2 = V.xy * asfloat(0x3E4CCCCDu) + spuv2;
		float  s2 = CommonNoiseMap.SampleBias(CommonNoiseMapSampler, spuv2, MaterialTextureMipBias).b * SparkIntensity;
		float  sk = s1 * (s1 * s2 - s1) + s1;
		sk = WuwaWPowGuard(sk, SparkPower);
		sk = sk * (so * (SparkIntensity - SparkIntensityInShadow) + SparkIntensityInShadow);
		sk = sk * AOt.g;
		E0 = sk * SparkColor + E0;
	}
	float  emLum = dot(E0, float3(0.3, 0.59, 0.11));

	// M280-286: attack dark scale on 1 - UV3.y
	float Dark = (asfloat(0x33000002u) >= Dark0) ? asfloat(0x3DCCCCCDu) : min(max(exp2(log2(Dark0) * AttackDarkScale), asfloat(0x3DCCCCCDu)), 1.0);

	// M287-314: attack fresnel rim with a screen-space dot pattern, x saturate(-view-space interpolated normal y)
	float2 dots = frac(ScreenUV * float2(2.0, 200.0)) + -0.5;
	bool   inDot = (0.5 >= sqrt(dot(dots, dots)));
	float  fr0 = 1.0 - NoVr;
	float  fr = (asfloat(0x33000002u) >= fr0) ? 0.0 : min(exp2(log2(fr0) * AttackFresnelRimRange), 1.0);
	float  inv = 1.0 - fr;
	inv = inv * ((asfloat(0x3F666666u) >= inv) ? 1.0 : 0.0);
	float  pat = inDot ? 0.0 : inv;
	float  frm = fr * ((fr >= asfloat(0x3DCCCCCDu)) ? 1.0 : 0.0);
	pat = frm * (1.0 - pat) + pat;
	float  down = saturate(-mul(WorldNormal, (float3x3)TranslatedWorldToView).y);
	pat = down * pat;

	// M315-322: attack emissive, selection
	float3 Rim = ((pat * AttackFresnelRimColor) * AttackFresnelRimIntensity) * FresnelAttackFactor;
	Rim = emLum * Dark + Rim;
	float3 E;
	if (bSDF || bSecond || bFresnelRim || bFresnelLit || bSpark)
	{
		E = FresnelAttackFactor * (Rim - E0) + E0;
	}
	else
	{
		E = FresnelAttackFactor * (Rim - EmissionColor * Em) + EmC;
	}
	E = SelectionColor.a * (SelectionColor.rgb - E) + E;

	// M323-332: dark scale, GI tint, ShadowLord colour -> GBufferC.rgb
	Lit = FresnelAttackFactor * (Lit * Dark - Lit) + Lit;
	float3 LitG = GI_Blend * (Lit * KuroViewGIColor - Lit) + Lit;
	float2 sluv = (GameTime * ShadowLord_ColorTiling.zw + UV3) * ShadowLord_ColorTiling.xy;
	float3 SL = ShadowLord_ColorTex.SampleBias(ShadowLord_ColorTexSampler, sluv, MaterialTextureMipBias).rgb;
	SL = (SL * ShadowLord_ColorMulti + 0.1) * ShadowLord_ColorOpacity;
	G.C.rgb = UseShadowLordMaterialDynamic * SL + LitG;

	// M366-384: emissive tail
	G.Emissive = WuwaBPFinalEmissive(E, KuroSkipEmissiveScale, KuroEmissiveScale, OutOfBoundsMask,
		WorldPosition, ObjectWorldPosition, ObjectBounds);

	// M385-407: MainTex.a shadow mask, solid-shadow colour (desaturated) -> GBufferB.rgb
	float3 Sc = Lit * ShadowColor;
	float3 Sv = Sc * SolidShadowView;
	float  sl = dot(Sv, float3(asfloat(0x3E59999Au), asfloat(0x3F372474u), asfloat(0x3D93A92Au)));
	Sv = SolidShadowSaturation * (Sc * SolidShadowView - sl) + sl;
	float  thr = min(SolidShadowThreshold, 0.99);
	float  t1 = sm - thr;
	Sv = (Sv - ShadowColor * Lit) * (t1 / (1.0 - thr));
	Sc = WuwaMOSignSat(t1) * Sv + Sc;

	// M408-426: GBufferA.z
	G.A.z = (so * 0.5 + 0.5) * (1.0 - (1.0 - 1.0) * SolidShadowStrength);

	if (bTranslucentDither)   // a605 l.378-413 (masked): UseTranslucent screen dither on MainTex.a, Kuro primitive dither clipped here,
	{                         // OpacityMask -> engine clip 0.3333 (the original discards min(primitive dither, mask - 0.3333) < 0)
		float op = MT.a;
		if (UseTranslucent >= 0.5)
		{
			op = MT.a * (1.0 - TranslucentDitherVaule) + TranslucentDitherVaule;
			float2 sp = SvPositionXY - ViewRectMin;
			uint2  cell = (uint2)(sp + TemporalAAParamsX);
			float  k5 = (float)(((cell.y << 1) + cell.x) % 5u);
			float  dt = TranslucentDitherTex.SampleBias(TranslucentDitherTexSampler, sp * 0.015625, MaterialTextureMipBias).r;
			op = (k5 + dt) * asfloat(0x3E2AAAABu) + op;
			op = op + -0.5;
		}
		clip(WuwaPrimDitherClip(KuroPrimDitherEnable, KuroPrimDitherFade, SvPositionXY));
		OpacityMask = op;
	}

	// M427-492: packings
	float3 Ne = N;
	if (bTwoSided)
	{
		Ne = N * rsqrt(dot(N, N));
	}
	G.A.xy = WuwaBPOctEncode(Ne);
	G.B.rgb = sqrt(saturate(Sc));
	G.B.a = WuwaBPShadingModelByte(LightingChannelMask, (0.0 < ToonShadowBlendCSMMask) ? 14u : 12u);
	if (KuroGBufferMode == 1.0)
	{
		G.C.a = WuwaBPRimByteEven(ToonRimWidth);
		G.D = float4(0.0, 0.0, 0.0, 0.0);
		G.A.w = 1.0;
	}
	else
	{
		uint rb = (uint)round(saturate(RoughA + RoughA) * 255.0) & 240u;
		G.D = float4(ToonRimWidth, (float)rb * WUWA_INV255, 0.0, 0.0);
		G.A.w = asfloat(0x3EAAAA3Bu);
		G.C.a = 0.0;
	}
	return G;
}

